Alembic migrations for LocalIQ.

The app applies these automatically on startup (see app/migrations.py). To run
them by hand from backend/:

    alembic upgrade head                       # apply all
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"   # new revision from model changes
    alembic downgrade -1                       # roll back one

DATABASE_URL (via .env) selects the database.
